  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu clan’s rank six Gu Immortal Wu Zhen Zhu urgently calls for white king head flower herb while Wu Ji is being treated after another near-death training run. She tells Wu Ji this is the fifth time that month, that the dead sea life retrieval formation saved her but loses effect with repeated use, and that chasing Kong Sheng Tian after already obtaining Sheng Tian true inheritance is playing with her life. When Wu Zhan Ping arrives to guide Wu Ji toward immortality, Wu Zhen Zhu is glad and later agrees that Corpse Emperor true inheritance and seven-seven profound soul true inheritance are rare chances.",
      "chapters": [
        2096
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_empress_wu_ji",
        "char_kong_sheng_tian",
        "inh_sheng_tian_true_inheritance",
        "char_wu_zhan_ping",
        "inh_corpse_emperor_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Wu Ji refuses the offered true inheritances, Wu Zhen Zhu urges that Wu Ji’s strength path true inheritance is low quality from only a rank six owner, and that strength path is declining compared with enslavement path or soul path, while qi path is rising again after the five regions merge. With Wu Zhan Ping she feels pity when Wu Ji still refuses.",
      "chapters": [
        2097
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
